<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East Bank declares 0.60-peso cash div.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank declares 0.60-peso cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank &amp; Trust Co said on Tuesday it declared a 0.60-peso cash dividend to shareholders on record as of December 31, 1996.  </p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on January 8, 1997.</p>
<p>The bank has so far paid 8.0 pesos worth of cash dividends for each shareholder for the latest year. In 1995, its cash dividends totalled 15 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Manila newroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
